<title>USA: Granite Financial Q2 Dec 31 net income.</title>
<headline>Granite Financial Q2 Dec 31 net income.</headline>
<dateline>WESTMINSTER, Colo. 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>GRANITE FINANCIAL INC</p>
<p>3 MOS ENDED DEC 31			     1996	   1995</p>
<p>Revenues</p>
<p>   Sales of leases			$17,428,941    $7,852,356</p>
<p>   Income from direct financing leases  981,890	   1,378</p>
<p>     Total revenues			18,410,831     7,853,734</p>
<p> Gross profit				 1,558,389	 578,004</p>
<p> Net income				     475,168	 193,887</p>
<p> Net income per share			    0.15	    0.10</p>
<p> Wgtd avg shrs				3,257,089     2,000,000</p>
<p>Note: Income taxes for the 1996 periods reflect federal and state income taxes including a one-time charge to earnings of $100,000 as part of the reorganization from an LLC to a C Corporation.  Income taxes for the 1995 periods reflect pro forma taxes at 37% as if the entity was taxed as a C Corporation.</p>
</text>
